---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const pillars = [
  { title: 'A Breakthrough in Optics', text: 'Our proprietary lens system delivers a uniquely smooth and comfortable visual experience. Designed from the ground up, our system uses a proprietary connection between diffractive lenses and a metasurface, allowing the metasurface to correct any visual aberrations or irregularities that are caused by the lens while maintaining a sleek form factor and low weight which prioritizes user comfort. It’s a technical breakthrough that supports extended use, making Somnex ideal for real-world productivity.' },
  { title: 'Deep Integration Between Hardware and Software', text: 'We’re developing purpose-built software specifically for our hardware. Unlike other platforms, Somnex runs a tightly integrated software stack optimized for training—reducing latency, improving responsiveness, and supporting realistic, interactive practice with machines in 3D space. This deep vertical integration means fewer compatibility issues and a smoother, faster user experience.' },
  { title: 'Tailored Tools for Machine Training', text: 'Our focus is on training people to work with machines. Beyond offering core XR capabilities, we’re building custom training tools—guided procedures, machine walkthroughs, spatial practice environments, and more—all designed for the unique strengths of digitally augmented environments. These tools are engineered to eliminate digital clutter and support intuitive learning.' },
];
---

<Base title="About Us" description="Somnex is an early stage startup building a next generation XR headset for hands-on training on machines.">
  <div class="page">
    <header class="page-header reveal"><h1>About</h1></header>

    <section class="panel reveal" data-label="01 // General">
      <h2>General</h2>
      <p>Somnex is an early stage startup that was founded in August 2024 with the vision of designing a next generation XR (Extended Reality) headset intended for immersive, hands on training on machines. The goal is to create a digital environment that connects more naturally with real-world workflows, helping people build practical skills and supporting sustained focus.</p>
      <p>In the long term, the project aims to change how people learn to operate machines by moving away from passive instruction and toward hands-on practice in an immersive workspace. This involves integrating the hardware, software, and connectivity to better support skill building, communication between trainers and trainees, more intuitive visualization, and guided practice in professional settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <p>At Somnex, we’re not just building another headset - we’re rethinking the foundation of extended reality (XR) for training. Our differentiation lies in three core areas:</p>
      <div class="about-tree">
        {pillars.map((p, i) => (
          <div class={`about-tree-item reveal ${i % 2 ? 'right' : 'left'}`}>
            <div class="card about-tree-card">
              <h3>{p.title}</h3>
              <p>{p.text}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
